#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:37 includes/Admin/Settings.php:96
msgid "FAUbox Settings"
msgstr "FAUbox Einstellungen"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:97
msgid ""
"Enter your FAUbox WebDAV credentials. You can generate them in your FAUbox "
"account under \"My Account\" →\n"
"   \"Devices\" → \"Add WebDAV connection\"."
msgstr ""
"Geben Sie Ihre FAUbox-WebDAV-Anmeldedaten ein. Diese generieren Sie in Ihrem "
"FAUbox-Konto unter „Mein Konto“ →\n"
"   „Geräte“ → „WebDAV-Verbindung hinzufügen“."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:111
msgid "FAUbox Username"
msgstr "FAUbox Benutzername"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:125
msgid "FAUbox WebDAV Token"
msgstr "FAUbox WebDAV Token"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:134
msgid "Token validity: 1 year. Generate a new token before it expires."
msgstr ""
"Gültigkeitsdauer des Tokens: 1 Jahr. Generieren Sie bitte vor Ablauf des "
"Tokens einen neuen."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:143
msgid "FAUbox Main Folder"
msgstr "FAUbox Hauptordner"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:153
msgid ""
"The main folder whose subfolders are to be displayed in the block editor."
msgstr ""
"Der Hauptordner, dessen Unterordner im Block-Editor angezeigt werden sollen."

